# Exposure target scopes and optional regex gates.
# Concrete domains here are expanded into config/sources/exposure.dorks templates.
# Gate-only regex lines are supported with regex:<pattern>.
# Keep real scope in local env or uncomment/add authorized domains only.
# example.edu.sg
# *.example.edu.sg
# regex:^([a-z0-9-]+\.)*example\.edu\.sg$
